  "title": "03/27/26 – Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. Announces Pricing of Upsized $10 Million Public Offering of Common Stock",
  "summary": "GARDNER, Mass., March 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. (NASDAQ: POCI), a leading designer and manufacturer of advanced optical instruments for the medical and defense/aerospace industries, today announced the pricing of its previously announced underwritten public offering of 2,777,777 shares of its common stock at a public offering price of $3.60 per […]",
